      "id": "claim_1f3291906dd54dbd8f47abff3e8b62a8",
      "statement": "Takeaway from fleet mode: each process session creates a conditional node-log record before its first fleet-durable acknowledgement, and a cold activation must check the prior owner's record before reading the bucket — absent means never acknowledged past the bucket, sealed means recovery completed, and open/recovering forces the recovery sequence (CAS-fence, seal reachable followers, upload retained segments, mark sealed) before restoring.",
