      "statement": "A deadline-cut handoff can leave a node-log recovery for the replacement: one process reads and uploads the dead session while the others wait, and a waiting process may replace an unresponsive recovery after 30 seconds so a failed recovery cannot block the fleet; a recovery store error keeps the session unsealed for later full-bundle re-recovery.",
